<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN one bln 10-yr bonds Dec 10.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN one bln 10-yr bonds Dec 10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland will offer one billion zlotys worth of floating 10-year bonds, maturing on January 18, 2007, on December 10, the Treasury said in a statement.</p>
<p>The value date for the auction is December 18.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
